  "summary": "A 26-year-old man, Caeden Hartman, was charged by the Platte County (Nebraska) Sheriff's Office after allegedly damaging a Flock camera at 48th Avenue and 53rd Street in Columbus on Oct. 11. Charges include terroristic threats, use of a firearm to commit a felony, criminal mischief over $5,000, use of a deadly weapon to commit a felony, and second-degree criminal trespass.",
  "key_quotes": [
